{"id": 299, "forum": "5-dekorativnye-vodoemy", "title": "Декоративный водоём-каток в Песочном (Лен. обл.). 2020", "posts": [{"id": 2069, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-08-18", "html": "<p>Мы приступили к строительству неглубокого декоративного водоёма в п. Песочное (Лен. обл.). Чаша водоёма полукруглой формы, глубиной всего 10 см. В борт, примыкающий к  дому будет вмонтировано 2 перелива из кореана шириной 2 метр. Приёмник из акваблоков и насосной камеры, куда будет сливаться вода из чаши. А зимой водоём будет использоваться как каток.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_23ca86cf2025cab1b9f59d1f054a463c", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.001.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_fa9093ae68ae5fbab95d1b7ace36110d", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.002.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_79193a640c3b86c5582d8b7d9d24f9b9", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.003.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_6f9586b1a158b1bb9f03665575c6d4e9", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.004.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_18ab675a69d61237f42daeba38720dfe", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.005.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_002481215312a005757bb2a8ac5d9aa9", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.006.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5d55910b6d0b095060236dc34d90fb8c", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.007.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2071, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-08-24", "html": "<p>Строительство основного водоёма завершено. Каток готов. Остались отдельные работы по стенке и чаше.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_d7b1a772e96983f8554e4f4dfc78ea5f", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.008.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f870297dc5d9e179d40ad0fcf2c84131", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.009.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_67d5a62f6116481f24a41837b0b75ea8", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.010.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_58ed74bc41820041586365da33b4820f", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.011.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_0bb8da7772e29f99ce3960e7b65831c3", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.012.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_955a4aecbf3e7589b48b82663af381e3", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.013.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_86f88caa578fd797b7b7457474b6f041", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.014.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_edd3bdfb0b36208955edb6e9be58dcc1", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.015.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f99bd3edb5860936b1deafb42d24db34", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.016.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9d7f66de6cf2e6c9569a685163d7739e", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.017.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e381e3f9c02d43a2d53d878779f48b8b", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.018.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_0cbcdf7058405c95ee9cbc86ebc794a9", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.019.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d38ccaf07055a64874aca5b056b4f344", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.020.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2102, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-10-20", "html": "<p>Строительство интересного декоративного водоёма завершено</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_8b4ad29e6304105d3a4be7e01e8208b0", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.021.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_29eb1c78af07ccef9818a2288aaf3bd3", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.022.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_4342f65040ef74deabb8b8f509753038", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.023.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2109, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-11-29", "html": "<p>Завершены ландшафтные работы вокруг водоёма</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_81687e1db2825be0dced079f44d60fb6", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.024.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ab7beadb9cd8cb31b17c503f0b6fca53", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.025.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_05818e71be867c6de507f12ca686c963", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.026.jpg"}]}, {"id": 2687, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2026-03-11", "html": "<p>Декоративный водоём в Песочном в июле 2023 г.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_f02dffed13171c04544aa4bce26080d3", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.2023.027.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_6f9ce4b810d5e832c91d6fb2a3cd05b8", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.2023.028.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7b707e4f211acc6b86242a051989fa4e", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.2023.029.jpg"}]}, {"id": 2690, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2026-03-12", "html": "<p>Обслуживание водоёма в мае 2024 г.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_e7865a2539b957f0a38660413efc1122", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.027.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e5964174a3f966f09c66468a38323746", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.028.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_8a4fed897ccb8bf6e41703d83729d103", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.029.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_8dcf999cea3e74b908ad49e5fb87a119", "thumb": "", "name": "ps.2020.030.jpg"}]}, {"id": 2706, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2026-08-10", "html": "<p>Обслуживание декоративного водоёма в Песочном в 2025 г.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_56becccad0875f1fce2920e5eae9440e", "thumb": "", "name": "pesochn.dekor.2025.033.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_03ff0deadbd8b49158754d2f5de238ff", "thumb": "", "name": "pesochn.dekor.2025.037.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_93f657d1a8511512536f09febbf20665", "thumb": "", "name": "pesochn.dekor.2025.038.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7688ceee849c59c216348c43af63f22e", "thumb": "", "name": "pesochn.dekor.2025.034.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_1c3bcff3ff2b2eeed12efe1f64697d01", "thumb": "", "name": "pesochn.dekor.2025.035.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_6dc8274b5178e307b620a49355b585c3", "thumb": "", "name": "pesochn.dekor.2025.039.jpg"}]}]}